{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new Shopify Online Store 2.0 section called “Single Editorial Banner” in the Bonne Soirée style — minimal, refined, editorial, and clean.
    
    Purpose:
    
    Display one large campaign image as a standalone banner.
    
    The same section will be duplicated on the page to create multiple separate banners, so each section must maintain visible spacing above and below it using the background color `#ebe4d8`.
    
    Layout:
    
    Desktop:
    
    * Display one single image.
    * Center the banner horizontally.
    * Maximum section width: 1280px.
    * Side padding: 32px.
    * The image should not occupy the entire browser width.
    * Maintain visible margins on the left and right.
    * Add 16px of spacing above and below the section so duplicated banners never touch each other.
    * The entire section background, including all margins and spacing, must use the color `#ebe4d8`.
    
    Mobile:
    
    * Display one single image.
    * Side padding: 12px.
    * Add 8px of spacing above and below the section.
    * The image should remain fully responsive.
    * The entire section background, including all margins and spacing, must use the color `#ebe4d8`.
    
    Image:
    
    * Include one desktop image picker.
    * Allow a separate mobile image.
    * If no mobile image is selected, use the desktop image.
    * Preserve the original image proportions.
    * Use width: 100%.
    * Use height: auto.
    * Do not crop the image.
    * Do not use object-fit: cover.
    * No rounded corners.
    * No borders.
    * No shadows.
    
    Link:
    
    * Include an optional link for the entire banner.
    * The whole image should be clickable when a link is added.
    * Do not display any visible button, text, overlay, or icon.
    
    Settings:
    
    * Desktop image picker.
    * Optional mobile image picker.
    * Optional banner link.
    * Adjustable maximum section width.
    * Adjustable desktop side padding.
    * Adjustable mobile side padding.
    * Adjustable top spacing.
    * Adjustable bottom spacing.
    
    Background:
    
    * Set the entire section background color to `#ebe4d8`.
    * The background color must extend across the full browser width.
    * Apply `#ebe4d8` to the side margins and the spacing above and below the banner.
    * Do not display any white background, white gaps, or white strips around or between duplicated sections.
    * The background color must remain consistent on desktop and mobile.
    
    Style:
    
    The result should feel like a luxury fashion campaign banner.
    
    Minimal and editorial, with clean spacing around the image using the background color `#ebe4d8`.
    
    The banner must remain visually separate from any duplicated banner placed directly above or below it.
    
    The section must be fully responsive and compatible with Shopify Online Store 2.0.
    , Update the “Single Editorial Banner” section with the following image requirements:
    
    * The desktop banner image will be uploaded at 8000 × 5111 pixels.
    * Preserve the exact original aspect ratio of 8000:5111.
    * Display the complete image without cropping, stretching, distortion, or repositioning.
    * Use width: 100% and height: auto.
    * Scale the image down responsively to fit within the section’s adjustable maximum width.
    * Do not force the image to render at its full 8000-pixel width.
    * Do not use a fixed height.
    * Do not use aspect-ratio containers that crop the image.
    * Do not use object-fit: cover.
    * The complete image must remain visible on both desktop and mobile.
    * Keep the section background color `#ebe4d8`, including all margins and spacing around the banner.
    * Maintain all previously created settings and functionality.
    , Remova o texto visível “```liquid” desta seção. Ele foi inserido por engano e não deve aparecer na página. Não altere nenhum outro elemento, imagem, espaçamento, configuração ou cor de fundo da seção.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-editorial-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #ebe4d8;
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.spacing_top_mobile }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.spacing_bottom_mobile }}px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-banner-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: {{ block.settings.padding_mobile }}px;
    padding-right: {{ block.settings.padding_mobile }}px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-banner-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .ai-editorial-banner-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-editorial-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-top: {{ block.settings.spacing_top_desktop }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.spacing_bottom_desktop }}px;
    }

    .ai-editorial-banner-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-left: {{ block.settings.padding_desktop }}px;
      padding-right: {{ block.settings.padding_desktop }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<single-editorial-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  class="ai-editorial-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="ai-editorial-banner-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.banner_link != blank %}
      <a
        href="{{ block.settings.banner_link }}"
        class="ai-editorial-banner-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        aria-label="View campaign"
      >
        {% if block.settings.mobile_image != blank %}
          <picture>
            <source
              media="(min-width: 750px)"
              srcset="{{ block.settings.desktop_image | image_url: width: 8000 }}"
            >
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.mobile_image | image_url: width: 2000 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.mobile_image.alt | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="{{ block.settings.mobile_image.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.mobile_image.height }}"
              class="ai-editorial-banner-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            >
          </picture>
        {% elsif block.settings.desktop_image != blank %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.desktop_image | image_url: width: 8000 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.desktop_image.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ block.settings.desktop_image.width }}"
            height="{{ block.settings.desktop_image.height }}"
            class="ai-editorial-banner-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-editorial-banner-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </a>
    {% else %}
      {% if block.settings.mobile_image != blank %}
        <picture>
          <source
            media="(min-width: 750px)"
            srcset="{{ block.settings.desktop_image | image_url: width: 8000 }}"
          >
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.mobile_image | image_url: width: 2000 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.mobile_image.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ block.settings.mobile_image.width }}"
            height="{{ block.settings.mobile_image.height }}"
            class="ai-editorial-banner-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
        </picture>
      {% elsif block.settings.desktop_image != blank %}
        <img
          src="{{ block.settings.desktop_image | image_url: width: 8000 }}"
          alt="{{ block.settings.desktop_image.alt | escape }}"
          loading="lazy"
          width="{{ block.settings.desktop_image.width }}"
          height="{{ block.settings.desktop_image.height }}"
          class="ai-editorial-banner-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
      {% else %}
        <div class="ai-editorial-banner-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</single-editorial-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class SingleEditorialBanner{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }
    }

    customElements.define('single-editorial-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }}', SingleEditorialBanner{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Single editorial banner",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Image"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "desktop_image",
      "label": "Desktop image"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "mobile_image",
      "label": "Mobile image"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Link"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "banner_link",
      "label": "Banner link"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "max_width",
      "label": "Maximum section width",
      "min": 800,
      "max": 1600,
      "step": 40,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 1280
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_desktop",
      "label": "Desktop side padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 32
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_mobile",
      "label": "Mobile side padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 12
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Spacing"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "spacing_top_desktop",
      "label": "Desktop top spacing",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "spacing_bottom_desktop",
      "label": "Desktop bottom spacing",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "spacing_top_mobile",
      "label": "Mobile top spacing",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "spacing_bottom_mobile",
      "label": "Mobile bottom spacing",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 8
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Single editorial banner"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}